# Generated
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# vbdoc runtime state
*.vbdoc.autosave/
.vb-export-tmp*/

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Kiln 导出副产物:任何情况下不入库(新版已改写系统临时目录,
# 此条防御旧版二进制/手工操作把它们写进工作树)
.kiln-raster/
.kiln-paintlist.json
.kiln-*.json

dist/*.exe
bench/artboard-baseline/tmp/

# bench:只留工具脚本;基线/产物/报告(除指定归档)一律不入库
bench/acceptance/baseline/
bench/acceptance/browser/
bench/acceptance/native/
bench/acceptance/kiln/
bench/acceptance/report-*
!bench/acceptance/report-archived.md
# 验收运行生成的截图/AI/PDF/文本报告均为本地产物，不进入仓库
bench/acceptance/*.json
bench/acceptance/*.md
bench/acceptance/tmp/
bench/tmp-*/
bench/*-baseline$name.*
bench/pdf-fidelity*/
bench/artboard-*/
bench/wpi-baseline/
bench/__pycache__/
bench/suite/baseline/
bench/suite/kiln/

# vb_app 阶段2:项目缩略图缓存(可随时再生成,不入库)
.vb-cache/

# K2 web 壳:构建产物与内置示例副本(build.ps1 生成,不入库)
crates/vb_web/web/pkg/
crates/vb_web/web/example/

# 自动快照目录(自动保存/崩溃恢复)不入库
.vb-autosave/
